# MX Creative Keypad report descriptor, one hidraw node carrying all five
# top-level collections. Synthetic: built from the collection list shensquared
# decoded on macOS (docs/research/logilinux-and-julusian-analysis.md §7.1:
# vendor page 0xFF43, 0x1A02 -> 0x11 in+out 19 B, 0x1A08 -> 0x13 in+out 31 B,
# 0x1A10 -> 0x14 out 4094 B, System Control -> 0x04, Consumer -> 0x05). The
# real dump replaces it after the hardware check (plan §5 item 1).
#
# 0x1A02: report 0x11, 19 bytes in and out
06 43 ff 0a 02 1a a1 01 85 11 75 08 95 13 15 00 26 ff 00 09 02 81 00 09 02 91 00 c0
# 0x1A08: report 0x13, 31 bytes in and out
06 43 ff 0a 08 1a a1 01 85 13 75 08 95 1f 15 00 26 ff 00 09 08 81 00 09 08 91 00 c0
# 0x1A10: report 0x14, 4094 bytes out only (two-byte report count)
06 43 ff 0a 10 1a a1 01 85 14 75 08 96 fe 0f 15 00 26 ff 00 09 10 91 00 c0
# Generic Desktop System Control: report 0x04, 1 byte in
05 01 09 80 a1 01 85 04 75 08 95 01 15 00 26 ff 00 19 00 29 ff 81 00 c0
# Consumer Control: report 0x05, 1 byte in
05 0c 09 01 a1 01 85 05 75 08 95 01 15 00 26 ff 00 19 00 29 ff 81 00 c0
